      "translations": {
        "en": "And whoever learns the Quran then forgets it deliberately, he will meet Allah on the Day of Judgment with a bite and shackles, and Allah will make a snake over him for every verse assigned to it. And whoever learns the Quran but does not act upon it and prefers the love of the world and its adornment, he deserves the displeasure of Allah (Exalted) and will be in the station with the Jews and Christians who cast the Book of Allah behind their backs. And whoever maries a woman lawfully but intends pride or show, Allah will not increase him except in humiliation and disgrace, and Allah will keep him on the slope of Hell for as long as he benefited from her, then he will fall into it for seventy years. And whoever withholds a woman her dowry, he is like a fornicator in the eyes of Allah, and Allah will say to him on the Day of Judgment: 'My servant, I married you to My slave girl according to My covenant, but you did not fulfill the covenant.' So Allah (Exalted and Mighty) will pursue her right, and he will lose all his good deeds, and he will not fulfill her right, so he will be ordered to Hell. And whoever returns a witness's testimony and conceals it, Allah will feed him his own flesh on the heads of creatures, and He will throw him into Hell while he chews his tongue. And whoever has two wives and does not do justice between them in himself and his wealth, he will come on the Day of Judgment shackled and crooked, his lip dragging, until he enters Hell."
